This directory vendors source files from two upstream projects. Both are
BSD 3-Clause licensed; the full texts are below.

1. flash-attn (csrc/flash_attn/src/*: flash_fwd_kernel.h, kernel_traits.h,
   block_info.h, utils.h, softmax.h, mask.h, dropout.h, rotary.h,
   namespace_config.h, philox.cuh)
   Copyright (c) 2022, the respective contributors, as shown by the AUTHORS
   file of the flash-attn repository.
   Source: https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention
   Commit: 060c9188beec3a8b62b33a3bfa6d5d2d44975fab (v2.8.3)

2. cutlass (cute/ and cutlass/ header closure, including the philox RNG
   header cutlass/util/random.cuh pulled in by dropout.h)
   Copyright (c) 2017 - 2025 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights
   reserved.
   SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
   Source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass
   Commit: dc4817921edda44a549197ff3a9dcf5df0636e7b (v3.9.2-18-gdc481792)

philox_unpack.cuh is a reinfer-authored compatibility shim replacing the
torch-dependent upstream file of the same name (BSD-3-Clause upstream);
its derivation is described in README.md.

